TIMING-6#1 Critical Warning
No common primary clock between related clocks  
The clocks clk_out1_kv260_video_clk_wiz_1_0 and mipi_phy_if_clk_p_FIFO_WRCLK_OUT are related (timed together) but they have no common primary clock. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks clk_out1_kv260_video_clk_wiz_1_0] -to [get_clocks mipi_phy_if_clk_p_FIFO_WRCLK_OUT]
